        "temperament": "Territorial",
        "wild": "Arctodus dirus is a massive, powerful bear that is aggressively territorial. It will attack anything that invades its territory without warning. Despite its imposing size, it is primarily a scavenger and forager, but it will readily hunt live prey when hungry or threatened. Few creatures can match its ferocity when it enters a rage state.",
        "domesticated": "The Dire Bear is a formidable mounted combatant that excels at gathering honey from bee hives without agitating the occupants. Its thick hide and powerful blows make it a durable frontline fighter. When threatened, it can enter a temporary rage that dramatically increases its damage output. It carries a rider without a saddle but benefits significantly from equipped gear."
